# CloudCompare AI — optional Vercel environment variable.
#
# In production Vercel proxies `/api/*` to the Render backend via vercel.json
# rewrites, so the frontend calls its OWN origin (same as the legacy static
# dashboard). That needs NO env var and NO CORS.
#
# Only set VITE_API_BASE if you deliberately want the browser to call the
# backend cross-origin instead of going through the Vercel proxy. If set, it
# must be the full backend URL WITHOUT a trailing slash, e.g.:
#   https://cloudcompare-ai-api.onrender.com
# and CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS on Render must allow your Vercel origin.
VITE_API_BASE=
